{"isResolved": false, "isOutdated": true, "path": "projection/src/index.ts", "line": null, "comments": [{"body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Drain more than 100 projection events per minute**\n\nIn a cell receiving more than 100 successful MCP `skill_retrieve` calls per minute, each retrieval adds a statistics event to this same ordered outbox, while the production cron runs only once per minute and this invocation processes at most 100 events. The backlog therefore grows indefinitely and delays every event behind it, including publications, privacy revocations, and resource-directory updates; coalesce retrieval statistics or continue draining within the invocation's execution budget so sustained traffic cannot exceed projector capacity.\n\nUseful? React with \ud83d\udc4d\u00a0/ \ud83d\udc4e.", "url": "https://github.com/21nCo/skillplane/pull/8#discussion_r3959651908"}]}
