Author: thyaravind <samalaaravind02@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Sep 3 19:29:14 2026 +0530

    fix(control-plane): bind migration buckets to regions and recover completion-pending runs

    Address the latest PR review findings on the workspace migration flow:

    - scripts/migrate-workspace.mjs: validate SKILLPLANE_SOURCE_BUCKET and
      SKILLPLANE_TARGET_BUCKET against the placement's source region and the
      requested target region via the per-region SKILLPLANE_CELL_<REGION>_BUCKET
      variables, mirroring the existing database-URL binding. A wrong-but-distinct
      target bucket previously passed every copy/verify check while the target
      cell served from its own configured bucket.
    - packages/control-plane/src/migration.ts: add an optional pendingCompletion
      journal lookup (implemented by PostgresWorkspaceMigrationJournal) and
      finalize a matching completion-pending run from its stored proof instead of
      repeating the data move. The CLI skips the placement-region assertions and
      rollback drill for that finalization path, since the placement is already
      active at the target and the assertions would reject the retry as a
      same-region migration.

    Regression coverage: bucket region-binding unit tests, and a journal test
    proving a retry finalizes the stored proof without restarting the run or
    repeating move operations.

    Co-authored-by: factory-droid[bot] <138933559+factory-droid[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>

